              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.6.1+1KI.6.2+1KI.6.3+1KI.6.4+1KI.6.5+1KI.6.6+1KI.6.7+1KI.6.8+1KI.6.9+1KI.6.10+1KI.6.11+1KI.6.12+1KI.6.13+1KI.6.14+1KI.6.15+1KI.6.16+1KI.6.17+1KI.6.18+1KI.6.19+1KI.6.20+1KI.6.21+1KI.6.22+1KI.6.23+1KI.6.24+1KI.6.25+1KI.6.26+1KI.6.27+1KI.6.28+1KI.6.29+1KI.6.30+1KI.6.31+1KI.6.32+1KI.6.33+1KI.6.34+1KI.6.35+1KI.6.36+1KI.6.37+1KI.6.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 6:1–38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1+2CH.3.2+2CH.3.3+2CH.3.4+2CH.3.5+2CH.3.6+2CH.3.7+2CH.3.8+2CH.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 3:1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi náona ukuta uchiozunguluka nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Ure wa cho chigongo cha kupimira chokala mkpwononi mwa ye mutu kala ni mita tahu, naye achipima nyo ukuta. Nyo ukuta kala una chimo cha mita tahu na upana wa mita tahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiphiya kpwenye ryango rilolaro uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa, achipanda yo ngaziye na achipima cho chizingiti cha ro ryango, chichikala ni mita tahu kuphiya ndani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila uphande wa pho phatu pha kuinjirira kala phana vyumba vihahu vya arindzi. Vyo vyumba kala vi sawa-sawa, mita tahu kpwa mita tahu na kuta zokala kahi ya chumba na chanjina kala ni mita mbiri na nusu na chizingiti cha ryango phephi na baraza kuelekezana na nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu kala vina upana wa chigongo chimwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achipima baraza iriyo pho ryangoni nayo ichituluka mita ne kuphiya ndani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na upana wa kuta za phatu pha kumenyera kala ni mita mwenga. Yo baraza iriyo pho ryangoni kala inalola uphande wa nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ro ryango ra mlairo wa dzuwa kala rina vyumba vya arindzi, vihahu uphande huno na vihahu uphande huno na vyosi kala visawa. Na zo kuta ambazo kala zi kahi-kahi ya chumba chimwenga na chanjina kala zi sawa chila uphande. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achipima upana wa phatu pha kumenyera nao uchikala ni mita tsano na upana wa varanda ya ryango nayo ichikala ni mita sita na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho phachikala na ukuta mfupi mbere ya vyo vyumba wenye upana wa sentimita mirongo mitsano na chimo cha sentimita mirongo mitsano na vyo vyumba kala ni mita tahu chila uphande. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achipima kula ukuta wa nyuma wa vyumba vya uphande hinyu hadi ukuta wa nyuma wa vyumba vya uphande wanjina; napho kala ni mita kumi na mbiri na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya achipima chimo cha kuta za phatu pha kumenyera baraza nacho chichikala mita kumi. Yo baraza kala inalolana na nyo muhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ure wa varanda ya kuinjirira kula ukuta wa kondze wa ryango hadi uphande wa mwisho wa chumba cha mwisho, kala ni mita mirongo miiri na tsano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zo kuta za nyuma ya vyo vyumba kala zina madirisha madide dza irivyokala yo baraza. Na zo kuta ziganyazo vyumba zachorwa mitende uphande unaololana na varanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho achinireha kpwenye muhala wa kondze. Hipho kala phana vyumba mirongo mihahu vyodzengbwa kugbwirana na nyo ukuta. Nyo mtsiriri mbere ya vyo vyumba kala ukadzengbwa na mawe kuzunguluka nyo muhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo upana wa mtsiriri kula ukuta wa vyo vyumba kuelekea muhalani wasisira hatuwa zizo ambazo ryango rafikira. Uhu ndio ndiokala mtsiriri wa tsini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achipima hatuwa kula ndani ya ryango hiri ambaro kala ri tsini hadi kondze ya muhala wa ndani napho kala ni mita mirongo mitsano. Huno kala ni uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa na bada ya hipha, huaphiya uphande wa vurini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho ye mutu achipima ure na mapana ga ryango ra muhala wa kondze rolola uphande wa vurini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyumbavye vya arindzi kala ni vihahu chila uphande. Nyo ukulu wa vyo vyumba, kutaze na barazaye kala vi sawa na vyo vyumba vya ryango ra kpwandza. Ure wa varanda ya kuinjirira ryangoni kala ni mita mirongo miiri na tsano na upanawe kala ni mita kumi na mbiri na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madirishage, barazaye na michoroye ya mitende kala i sawa na yo ya ryango rilolaro mlairo wa dzuwa. Kala phana ngazi yenye nyago sabaa ya kupandira pho ryangoni wakati mutu anainjira pho varandani kuphiya mwenga kpwa mwenga hadi kpwenye baraza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hura muhala wa ndani kala una ryango rololana na ryango ra uphande wa vurini, dza vira kurivyokala uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa. Achipima hatuwa kahi ya maryango mairi gololana, napho kala phana ure wa mita mirongo mitsano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
