              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achinireha muhala wa ndani, nako kala kuna vyumba viiri. Chimwenga kala chi kanda ya ryango ra vurini nacho kala chinalola mwakani, cho chanjina kala chi kanda ya ryango ra mwakani nacho kala chinalola vurini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi waniamba, “Chumba hichi chilolacho mwakani ni cha alavyadzi-sadaka aimirirao nyumba ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na chumba chilolacho vurini ni cha alavyadzi-sadaka aimirirao phatu pha kulavira sadaka yani a chivyazi cha Sadoki. Aha ndio Alawi machiyao ambao anaruhusiwa kuphiya mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu kumuhumikira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wapima nyo muhala wa ndani, urewe kala ni mita mirongo mitsano na upanawe kala ni mita mirongo mitsano. Na pho mbere za nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu kala phana phatu pha kulavira sadaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
